e determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}-6\\cdot \\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =2-2 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$"}]}
